    "reviewed_explanation": {
      "text": "Bakery, senior centre, and food bank must be three stops in a row. If that block took stops 1–3, the pharmacy would be stop 4 or 5, which breaks the early rule. If it took stops 2–4, the pharmacy would need stop 1 and the library would be last, which is not allowed. So the block is stops 3–5, and the pharmacy and library take stops 1 and 2 in either order.",
